(d) Within 1,000 feet of any parcel of land inside or outside the city upon which any establishment selling alcoholic beverages is located;
(e) Reserved.
(f) In the same building as another adult entertainment establishment regulated or defined hereunder is located.
(2) How to measure distances. For the purpose of this subsection, distance shall be by airline measurement between the closest property line on which the adult entertainment establishment is located to the closest property line on which the other use is located. The term "parcel of land" means any quantity of land capable of being described by location and boundary, designated and used or to be used as a unit.
